Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 19:54:46 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] qcrilam: skip wifi-only and stop after first hal connect

bootreceiver started qcrilamservice on non-qualcomm and wi-fi-only
devices, and addcallbackforsimslot unconditionally probed all three
audio interfaces (radio.am hidl, qcril.am hidl, and radio.am aidl)
even after the first succeeded, causing 121 selinux denials on
qualcomm hidl devices and wasted work on wi-fi-only tablets.

skip starting the service unless telephony is present, ril is not
disabled, and hardware or egl is qualcomm/adreno. stop immediately
when simcount <= 0, probe aidl non-blockingly then both hidl
interfaces without retry, return on first success, and only retry
radio.am hidl if none of the three is ready yet.
---
 src/me/phh/qcrilam/BootReceiver.kt   |  23 ++++-
 src/me/phh/qcrilam/QcRilAmService.kt | 147 +++++++++++++++------------
 2 files changed, 105 insertions(+), 65 deletions(-)

